## 3. Processing step

Vary subcopy by branch when low effort (Send pattern):

- Default: “Please wait while we securely…”
- External / on-chain: “Broadcasting to network…”
- Bank / fiat: “Submitting withdrawal to your bank…”

Then branch after timeout: `simulate === null` → success wrap; else → `renderOutcome(mode, txId)`.

---

## 4. Stepper contract (terminal states)

| Terminal result | Last stepper node | Progress |
|-----------------|-------------------|----------|
| Success | All nodes **completed** (checks) | 100% |
| Failure / pending / review | Last node **active** (number, not check) | Not 100% |

Track with e.g. `lastOutcomeSuccess` or `simulate === null` at step 7 — see [flow-stepper](newunera-flow-stepper.mdc) processing/success mapping.

---

## 5. Accessibility

- Blocking banner: `role="alert"`.
- Outcome wrap: `role="region"`, `aria-live="polite"`, `aria-atomic="true"`.
- Focus: `tabindex="-1"` on outcome/success `h2`; move focus on step transition.
- Demo pills: `role="group"` + descriptive `aria-label`; `.demo-btn:focus-visible` ring `--brand-deep-blue`.
- Confirm disabled: `aria-disabled="true"` when review blocker active.

---

## 6. Adapting to new action flows

When adding edge/outcome UX to **Get UNERA CAD**, **Redeem**, **Exchange**, etc.:

1. Add soft warnings + blocking banner hooks to **review** step.
2. Add demo pill rows (outcome + blocker) with path-specific pill tables.
3. Split terminal step into success + outcome wraps (or extend existing `#failFlowWrap` toward this contract).
4. Centralize receipt rows; map simulate keys to title, status, CTAs in one config object (Send `configs` pattern).
5. Align stepper terminal behavior.

**Existing partial implementations to converge:**
- Get UNERA CAD: `#failFlowWrap` + review `setTxSimulate` pills — add dual-wrap receipt panel parity.
- Redeem: `renderTxState('pending'|'failed')` — align icon/badge/tip tokens with this rule.
- KYC: `demo-btns` + `renderOutcome()` — outcome screen is reference for **review/compliance** states, not wallet receipts.

---

## 7. Do not

- ❌ Lightning badge or stroked success check on failure/pending/review screens
- ❌ Persist demo outcome to `localStorage` or URL (except optional `?reviewEdge=` for blockers)
- ❌ Hardcode hex — use `--surface-error-soft`, `--surface-warning-soft`, `--error`, `--warning`, `--brand-purple`
- ❌ CSS gradient functions on product HTML ([`new-brand-output.mdc`](new-brand-output.mdc))
- ❌ Mark stepper 100% complete on failed sends
- ❌ Use `--neutral-500` for `.demo-label` or receipt labels (WCAG — use `--text-secondary`)
- ❌ Show success footer CTAs alongside outcome CTAs (hide `#…SuccessActions`)

---

## 8. Verification checklist

- [ ] Each flow branch shows exactly one soft warning on review
- [ ] Blocker demo disables confirm until resolved
- [ ] Each outcome pill lands on correct detail screen (not success hero)
- [ ] Receipt rows match between success and outcome for same tx
- [ ] Stepper checks only on happy path
- [ ] `resetFlow()` clears simulate + review edge + restores success wrap
- [ ] Demo pills wrap at 768px; tap targets ≥ 44px
